  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00148",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "这夜之后，杜子春成了洛阳数一数二的大财主。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After that night, Toshishun became one of the richest men in Luoyang.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00148",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "就像老人家说的那样，他在暮光中观察身影，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Just as the old man had said, he watched his shadow in the twilight,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00148",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "记下了影子脑袋部位所在的方向，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and noted the direction where the head of the shadow pointed,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00148",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "半夜里偷偷去挖，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "then went out secretly in the middle of the night to dig,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00148",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "果然挖出了很多黄金，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and sure enough, he dug up a great deal of gold,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00148",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "装满一大车还余下不少。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "enough to fill a large cart with plenty still left over.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
